  "compatibility": {
    "hardware_assessment": "93LC66B-I/SN is a valid documented source-option family for this 3.3V FT2232H EEPROM interface, with matching standard eight-pin B-version pinout.",
    "limitations": [
      "93LC56B and 93LC66B differ in capacity and meaningful address bits. This review does not validate EEPROM contents, FT_PROG configuration, USB descriptors, device detection or programming on real hardware.",
      "The exact source suffix/package is absent. Retain the known existing 93LC66B-I/SN SOIC model; do not assume a SOT23 six-pin or rotated-X SOIC package has this map.",
      "Pin6 tied high reproduces the source. It does not select x16 on B variants; pin6 is NC. Do not relabel a B-version physical pin as functional ORG.",
      "Pin4 must remain separated from pin3 by R228 2k. A direct short would omit the source resistor.",
      "FT2232HL has channel A JTAG plus one UART on channel B; the source FT4232 optional UART1 and UART3 wiring is not extra FT2232 UART functionality."
    ]
  },
